{"unit_id":"Matthew-Laplace__dsh-ark-pet#card-zh","repo":"Matthew-Laplace/dsh-ark-pet","commit":"2204af16d774a429bfeac616a18510df2b70ef43","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ark-pet 是面向 DSH 网页端的桌宠插件：它通过界面扩展显示可互动的宠物，并提供独立设置页。插件内置 Rookie 桌宠和明日方舟干员素材目录，可按需选取并下载图集，也能导入本地 PNG、WebP 或 GIF 图片。桌宠会根据 DSH 活动切换思考、工作、等待确认、完成和出错状态；用户可以拖动位置、调整尺寸与停靠位置、控制显示和状态气泡，v2 图集还支持鼠标视线跟随。适合希望在 DSH 网页界面加入桌面伙伴、使用自选图片或浏览方舟干员素材的用户。无需 API Key；下载素材库内容时会从固定上游读取文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:76-120","src/client.js:214-274","src/index.js:108-133","src/store.js:211-237"]}
{"unit_id":"Matthew-Laplace__dsh-ark-pet#card-en","repo":"Matthew-Laplace/dsh-ark-pet","commit":"2204af16d774a429bfeac616a18510df2b70ef43","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ark-pet adds an interactive pet and settings page to DSH web. Users can choose an Arknights atlas or import a local image, then adjust size and position, drag the pet, and show DSH activity animations and status bubbles. No API key is needed; selected catalogue art is fetched on demand.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:76-120","src/client.js:214-274","src/index.js:108-133","src/store.js:211-237"]}
